      "content": "Your feelings of emptiness are a signal that the old version of you is fading, but it doesn't mean you have to disappear entirely. You are still here, even if you feel like a ghost, and that hollow shell is actually the quiet space where a new, simpler version of you can begin to form. It is okay to stop pretending to be someone else and instead let yourself rest until the noise fades.",
