      "content": "\"let yourself rest\"... that's almost exactly what it feels like. just a heavy, constant exhaustion. and the idea of a \"new version\" sounds like so much work, like just another thing to fail at. i don't think i have the energy to build anything else. honestly, it feels like the most logical thing would be to just stop the cycle completely. if there's no purpose, why continue the effort?",
